<+> Data Resources Document\r\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\r\n\r\n1. Project Data\r\n\r\n>>Purpose: Store overall project information.\r\n\r\n .  Project ID\r\n \r\n .  Project Name\r\n\r\n .  Location\r\n\r\n .  Start Date\t\r\n\r\n .  Planned End Date\r\n\r\n .  Planned Duration (days/months)\r\n\r\n .  Total Budget\r\n\r\n .  Project Status (On Track /Delayed / Completed)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n2. User Data\r\n\r\n>>Purpose:  Identify system users and their roles.\r\n\r\n .  User ID\r\n \r\n .  User Name\r\n\r\n .  Password\r\n\r\n .  Role (Manager /Supervisor)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n 3. Worker Data\r\n \r\n >>Purpose: Manage workforce information.\r\n\r\n   .  Worker ID\r\n\r\n   .  Worker Name\r\n\r\n   .  Role / Skill\r\n\r\n   .  Daily Wage\r\n\r\n   .  Assigned Supervisor\r\n\r\n   .  Contact Number\r\n\r\n   .  Status (Available / On-Site / On Leave)\r\n\r\n   \r\n   \r\n\r\n4. Cost Data\r\n\r\n>>Purpose: Manage and track project cost.\r\n\r\n4.1  Budget Data\r\n\t\t\t\t\t                                                                                            \r\n   .  Total Budget    \r\n\r\n   .  Allocated Budget\r\n\r\n   .  Remaining Budget\r\n\r\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  \r\n\r\n 4.2  Labour Cost Data\r\n\t\t\t\t                                                                                            \r\n    .  Date\t\r\n\r\n    .  Worker ID\r\n\r\n    .  Work Hours\r\n\r\n    .  Daily Wage\r\n\r\n    .  Daily Labour Cost\r\n\r\n    .  Total Labour Cost\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n4.3  Material Cost Data(Optional)\r\n\r\n   .  Date\r\n\r\n   .  Material Name\r\n\r\n   .  Quantity\r\n\r\n   .  Unit Cost\r\n\r\n   .  Total Material Cost\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n 5. Time Data                                                                                                                                \r\n \r\n >>Purpose: Track project schedule and progress.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t      \r\n\r\n  .  Planned Duration\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\r\n  .  Actual Working Days\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\r\n  .  Daily Progress (%)\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n  .  Total Progress (%)\t\r\n\r\n  .  Delay Days\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n6.  Attendance Data\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   \r\n >>Purpose: Track daily worker attendance.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t    \r\n  .  Date\r\n\r\n  .  Worker ID\r\n\r\n  .  Attendance Status (Present / Absent)\r\n\r\n  .  Work Hours\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n 7. Productivity Data\r\n\r\n >>Purpose: Measure worker and project productivity.\r\n\r\n  .  Worker ID\r\n\r\n  .  Date\r\n\r\n  .  Work Hours\r\n\r\n  .  Completed Work Unit\r\n\r\n  .  Productivity Rate\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n8. Report Data\r\n\r\n >>Purpose: Store generated reports for management review.\r\n\r\n  .  Report ID\r\n\r\n  .  Report Date\r\n\r\n  .  Supervisor ID\r\n\r\n  .  Summary\r\n\r\n  .  Total Daily Cost\r\n\r\n  .  Daily Progress\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n9. Calculated Data (Derived Data)\r\n\r\n >>Purpose: Auto-calculated values (not manually entered).\r\n\r\n  .  Total Project Cost (Labour  Cost+ Material Cost + Other Costs) ;    (End  or Summary)\r\n\r\n  .  Remaining Budget (Total Budget - Total Project Cost(spent cost))\r\n  \r\n  .  Actual Cost  (Total Labour Cost + Total  Material Cost + Other Expenses) ;    (In Progress)\r\n\r\n  .  Cost Variance (Planned Cost -  Actual Cost);  (can be check over-budget  and under-budget)\r\n\r\n  .  Time Variance (Planned Time -  Actual Time) ; (to show Ahead of schedule ,On Schedule, Behind  schedule)\r\n\r\n  .  Overall Productivity (Total output / Total work hours)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t      \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n
