<+>+++++ IPP System Requirements +++++\r\n\r\n======================================\r\n|\t\t\t\t                     |\r\n|\tFunctional Requirements\t         |\r\n|\t\t\t\t                     |\r\n======================================\r\n\r\n+ Login Function\r\n+ Create the New Project\r\n+ Adding the Schedule and tasks in each project ( include start and end date of the project)\r\n+ Enter the planed value (PV), Earned value (EV) \r\n+ Calculate the project cost and performance (BAC)\r\n+ Update project information\r\n+ view project progress\r\n+ Record the project (Stopped the project, Finished project, Doing Project)\r\n+ Database store\r\n+ \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n======================================\r\n|\t\t\t\t                     |\r\n|     Non Functional Requirements    |     \r\n|\t\t\t\t                     |\r\n======================================\r\n\r\n+ Secure in system\r\n+ User Access checking\r\n+ user friendly interface\r\n+ HikariCP for the database connection\r\n+ multiple process without performance loss\r\n+ must be clean code\r\n+ fast response time\r\n+ \r\n\r\n\r\n======================================\r\n|\t\t\t\t                     |\r\n|\t  Data Requirements    \t         |\r\n|\t\t\t\t                     |\r\n======================================\r\n\r\n+ Project (Create or Edit or Delete)\r\n+++ Project Name/Description\r\n+++ Project Type\r\n+++ Start Date \r\n+++ Planned End Date\r\n+++ Actual End Date\r\n+++ Project Status (Planned/InProgress/Completed/Deleted)\r\n+++ Project Manager\r\n+++ Client/Owner\r\n+++\r\n\r\n\r\n+ Task/Activity Data\r\n+++ Task Name/Description\r\n+++ Project Name\r\n+++ planned start date\r\n+++ planned finished date\r\n+++ Actual Start Date\r\n+++ Actual Finish Date\r\n+++ Task Duration\r\n+++ Task Status\r\n\r\n+ Time Management Data (For Schedule Control )\r\n+++ Planned Duration (days)\r\n+++ Actual Duration\r\n+++ Delay Days\r\n+++ Critical Task (Yes/No) <==\r\n+++ Task Dependencies <==\r\n\r\n+ Cost/Finical Data (Important) (Engineering Cost Control)\r\n+++ Budgeted Cost (Planned Cost)\r\n+++ Actual Cost\r\n+++ Cost Type (Labor/Material/Equipment)\r\n+++ Payment Date\r\n+++ Cost Status <== \r\n\r\n+ Earned Value Management (EVM) Data\r\n+++ Planned Value(PV)\r\n+++ Earned Value(EV)\r\n+++ Actual Cost(AC)\r\n+++ Cost Variance(CV = EV - AC)\r\n+++ Schedule Variance (SV = EV - PV)\r\n+++ Cost Performance Index (CPI)\r\n+++ Schedule Performance Index (SPI)\r\n\r\n+ Labor/Human Resource Data\r\n\r\n+++ Name\r\n+++ Role (Engineer/Workers/Supervisor/manager)\r\n+++ Skill Type\r\n+++ Assigned Project\r\n+++ Working Hours\r\n+++ Hourly Rate\r\n+++ Total Labor Cost\r\n\r\n+ Material Management Data\r\n\r\n+++ Material Name\r\n+++ Quantity Planned <==\r\n+++ Quantity Used <==\r\n+++ Unit Cost\r\n+++ Supplier <==\r\n+++ Total Material Cost\r\n\r\n+ Equipment Data <===*** (Not Necessary)\r\n+++ Equipment Name\r\n+++ Usage Hours\r\n+++ Rental Cost/Purchase Cost\r\n+++ Maintenance Cost\r\n\r\n+ Risk Management Data <==\r\n+++ Risk Description\r\n+++ Risk Type (Cost/Time/Safety)\r\n+++ Probability \r\n+++ Impact\r\n+++ Mitigation Plan\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n======================================\r\n|\t\t\t\t                     |\r\n|\t  For UI/UX Design               |\r\n|\t\t\t\t                     |\r\n======================================\r\n\r\n\r\n+ For Manager Role\r\n+++\r\n\r\n+ For Supervisor Role\r\n+++\r\n
